#QLCIR-G1
# name: detector_refinement_f4_e2_d5
# family: physics/detector-refinement
# expected: UNSAT
# physical: Monotonicity of coarse-grained measurement events / detector-bin merging.
# note: Fine event with 4 outcomes is explicitly included in a coarser event obtained by adding 2 outcomes; asks for a state in fine but outside coarse.
dim(5)
output(4)
1 = or(fine0, fine1, fine2, fine3)
2 = or(1, extra0, extra1)
3 = not(2)
4 = and(1, 3)
